    "title": "DecisionOS API v1",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "DecisionOS — Enterprise Platform for Managed Decision & Execution.\n\nAuthentication: Header `X-API-Key: <your-key>`\n\nSupported endpoints:\n- `/submit` — Submit job (backward compatible)\n- `/v1/decisions` — Decision create/list/evaluate\n- `/v1/jobs/{id}/...` — Job retry/cancel/complete/worker-ack\n- `/status/{id}` — Job status\n- `/jobs` — List jobs\n- `/usage` — Tenant usage metrics\n- `/billing/create-checkout-session` — Stripe checkout\n- `/health` — Health & PG status\n- `/api/chat/stream` — AI Assistant with tool calling"
  },
